    memoryTip: "\u{1F9E0} Nh\u1EDB: 'Nh\xF3m 1 h\xE0ng A th\xEAm RERU; Nh\xF3m 2 th\xEAm RARERU; K\u1EBB t\xE1c \u0111\u1ED9ng ph\u1EA3i \u0111i v\u1EDBi NI!'",
