    memoryTip: "\u{1F9E0} Nh\u1EDB: 'THA \u0110\u1ED8NG T\u1EEA \u0111i v\u1EDBi TE ARU; Tr\u1EE3 t\u1EEB bi\u1EBFn th\xE0nh G\xC1; c\xF3 ai \u0111\xF3 l\xE0m s\u1EB5n ch\u1EDD ta!'",
