    memoryTip: "\u{1F9E0} Nh\u1EDB: 'KAMOSHIREMASEN l\xE0 n\u0103m \u0103n n\u0103m thua; HAZU DESU l\xE0 ch\u1EAFc m\u1EA9m c\xF3 s\xE1ch m\xE1ch c\xF3 ch\u1EE9ng!'",
