        type: "multiple_choice",
        question: "Ch\u1ECDn c\xE2u \u0111\xFAng khi n\xF3i v\u1EC1 d\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ECBnh c\u1EE7a anh Tanaka: 'Anh Tanaka \u0111ang \u0111\u1ECBnh mua nh\xE0':",
