    memoryTip: "\u{1F9E0} Nh\u1EDB: 'Ti\u1EBFn b\u1ED9 th\xEC YOU NI NARU (\u0111\xE3 l\xE0m \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c r\u1ED3i); Tho\xE1i lui th\xEC NAKUNARU (h\u1EBFt l\xE0m \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c r\u1ED3i)!'",
