    memoryTip: "\u{1F9E0} Nh\u1EDB: 'KUREMASU th\xEC ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kh\xE1c l\xE0 ch\u1EE7 ng\u1EEF; MORAIMASU th\xEC T\xD4I l\xE0 ch\u1EE7 ng\u1EEF nh\u1EADn \u01A1n!'",
