    memoryTip: "\u{1F9E0} Nh\u1EDB: 'B\u1EBF t\u1EAFc h\u1ECFi TARA II DESU KA; M\xE1ch n\u01B0\u1EDBc khuy\xEAn b\u1EA1n TARA DOU DESU KA!'",
