    memoryTip: "\u{1F9E0} Nh\u1EDB: 'C\u1ED1 g\u1EAFng th\xE0nh th\xF3i quen th\xEC YOU NI SURU; Y\xEAu c\u1EA7u ngay l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c th\xEC TE KUDASAI!'",
